# Remember to never publicly share your keystore.
# See https://flutter.dev/to/reference-keystore
key.properties
**/*.keystore
**/*.jks
# This app has no Play Store presence and is only ever distributed as a
# directly-downloaded APK for internal testing, so the tradeoff here is
# committing this specific release key rather than every CI build getting
# a fresh random debug key (which made every new build uninstallable-over
# the last one). Deliberately checked in - see build.gradle.kts.
!key.properties
!app/upload-keystore.jks
